# Bill of Materials (BOM)

**Project:** Mimir ESP32-S3 Carrier Board

**Revision:** 1.2

This Bill of Materials lists all components required to fully assemble one Mimir ESP32-S3 Carrier Board.

---

# Required Components

| Qty | Item | Description | Notes |
|----:|------|-------------|-------|
| 1 | ESP32 Development Board | UIICPAL ESP32-S3 N16R8 (16 MB Flash / 8 MB PSRAM) | Required |
| 1 | Carrier PCB | Mimir ESP32-S3 Carrier Board | Manufactured PCB |
| 1 | CAN Bus Module | SN65HVD230 CAN Bus Transceiver Module | Required |
| 1 | MicroSD Module | SPI MicroSD Adapter Module | Required |
| 2 | 22-Pin Female Header | 2.54 mm Pitch PCB Female Header | ESP32 Socket |
| 2 | 12-Pin Screw Terminal | 2.54 mm Pitch PCB Screw Terminal | GPIO Connections |
| 2 | 10-Pin Screw Terminal | 2.54 mm Pitch PCB Screw Terminal | GPIO Connections |
| 2 | 2-Pin Screw Terminal | 2.54 mm Pitch PCB Screw Terminal | Power Input |

